# This root-level file is only a pointer for newcomers.
# Runtime examples live in:
# - backend/.env.example
# - frontend/.env.example
#
# Quick start:
# 1. Copy backend/.env.example -> backend/.env
# 2. Fill in LLM_API_KEY in backend/.env
# 3. Copy frontend/.env.example -> frontend/.env
# 4. Start backend, then frontend
#
# See docs/GETTING_STARTED.md for the full setup guide.
